# Input

```html
<div><!-- before element -->
<i>x</i></div>
<div><!-- trailing space --> 
<i>x</i></div>
<div> <!-- surrounded by spaces --> 
<i>x</i></div>
<div><!-- before text -->
text</div>
<div><!-- a --><!-- b -->
<p>x</p></div>
<pre><!-- verbatim -->
foo</pre>

```


# Formatted

```html
<div>
	<!-- before element -->
	<i>x</i>
</div>
<div>
	<!-- trailing space --> <i>x</i>
</div>
<div>
	<!-- surrounded by spaces --> <i>x</i>
</div>
<div>
	<!-- before text -->
	text
</div>
<div>
	<!-- a --><!-- b -->
	<p>x</p>
</div>
<pre><!-- verbatim -->
foo</pre>

```



